{"availability":"available","full":"m90312601-tech/Paralives-Assist-Menu","name":"Paralives-Assist-Menu","description":"Paralives Trainer 2026 Infinite Funds and Needs Freeze Mod Menu for PC","category":"Finance","language":"HTML","stars":53,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-21T22:05:06Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:20:43Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["building-game","free-builder","game-trainer","game-trainers","infinite-money","life-simulation","mod","paralives","paralives-cheats","paralives-mod","paralives-mods","paralives-trainer","sandbox","single-player","trainer","windows"],"demo":"https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:56.697Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:56.697Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:56.697Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:17:17.598Z","stars":53,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:29:24.795Z","stars":53,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:07:35.102Z","stars":53,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:06:56.697Z","stars":53,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Parafolk Playground Studio is a lovingly crafted, community-driven companion toolkit for Paralives players who want to bend the rules of their virtual dollhouse without breaking the immersion. Think of it as a backstage pass to your own life-simulation theatre — a director's chair, a lighting rig, and a script you can rewrite whenever the mood strikes.","Whether you are a storyteller weaving generational sagas, a builder chasing architectural perfection, or a casual dreamer who simply wants their Parafolk to stop complaining about hunger pangs at 3 AM, this companion framework meets you exactly where you are — and then hands you the keys to the kingdom.","Paralives promises a warm, expressive, deeply personal life-simulation sandbox. Parafolk Playground Studio is the invisible assistant that sits quietly beside that sandbox, offering a set of enhancements designed to remove friction, unlock creativity, and let you play at your own pace."],"features":["Every feature in Parafolk Playground Studio was born from a real conversation with real players. Nothing here is filler. Everything here is fuel for your imagination.","The in-game economy is a beautiful thing when it works for you. Parafolk Playground Studio offers an Infinite Ledger module that lets you decide what money means in your world.","Infinite Money Mode — Your household funds become a number that never runs dry. Build the mansion. Buy the art. Tip the barista a thousand simoleon-equivalents. Nobody is counting.","One-Press Funds — A single tap tops up your wallet to a comfortable cushion. Perfect for players who want a safety net without abandoning the game's progression entirely.","Selective Wealth — Choose which households benefit from the Infinite Ledger and which ones still have to earn their bread. Great for legacy challenges."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m90312601-tech/Paralives-Assist-Menu/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"454eca49f21ed0b717742c31460221e47a62f3065583dee0c9e2001767856f40","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:12:02.835Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:56.790Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Parafolk Playground Studio is a lovingly crafted, community-driven companion toolkit for Paralives players who want to bend the rules of their virtual dollhouse without breaking the immersion. Think of it as a backstage pass to your own life-simulation theatre — a director's chair, a lighting rig, and a script you can rewrite whenever the mood strikes.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m90312601-tech/Paralives-Assist-Menu/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"One-Press Funds — A single tap tops up your wallet to a comfortable cushion. Perfect for players who want a safety net without abandoning the game's progression entirely.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/m90312601-tech/Paralives-Assist-Menu/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fin